@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il07-nouns`
IMPORT `il07-pipeline`
IMPORT `nii-s334-interpretation`

-- ===========================================================================
-- IL-13: the second independent test pass over the IL-07 capstone, v0.2.2.
-- Author fid-il-13. EVERY EXPECTED VALUE is copied from DECIDED-ANSWERS-2.md,
-- which was finished at 2026-10-08T06:42:48Z before any .l4 file was opened,
-- and is generated from that file by a script (scratch gen_tests.py), so no
-- expected value here was written after seeing the encoding's answer.
-- Inputs are the households of DECIDED-ANSWERS-2.md in the capstone's nouns.
-- Each household has five assertions: one twelfth of the tax, the NI
-- deduction, the health contribution (an input, read back through the
-- household's month), the child allowance, the net.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `IL-13 — builders`

GIVEN nm IS A STRING
      fem IS A BOOLEAN
      dob IS A DATE
      sal IS A NUMBER
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      `full minimum wage` IS A BOOLEAN
      `no other credit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `IL-07 earner`
`i2: earner` nm `, woman:` fem `, born:` dob `, paid:` sal `, resident:` resident `, full minimum wage:` `full minimum wage` `, no other credit:` `no other credit` MEANS
    `IL-07 earner` WITH
        `the earner's name`                                                              IS nm
        `the earner is a woman`                                                          IS fem
        `the earner's date of birth`                                                     IS dob
        `the earner's monthly salary`                                                    IS sal
        `the earner is paid that salary in every month of the tax year`                  IS TRUE
        `the earner was an Israeli resident in the tax year, under the Income Tax Ordinance` IS resident
        `the earner is a foreign worker`                                                 IS FALSE
        `the earner is a resident of the Area who is not an Israeli citizen`             IS FALSE
        `the earner is insured under Chapter 11 of the National Insurance Law`           IS resident
        `the earner is resident in Israel, under the National Insurance Law`             IS resident
        `the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over applies to the earner` IS `full minimum wage`
        `the earner's age fixed by Part D of Schedule A1 to the National Insurance Law, in months, if a woman` IS NOTHING
        `the earner has no credit or deduction under the Income Tax Ordinance beyond those the composed rows encode` IS `no other credit`

GIVEN nm IS A STRING
      fem IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `IL-07 spouse`
`i2: spouse without income` nm `, woman:` fem MEANS
    `IL-07 spouse` WITH
        `the spouse's name`                                                              IS nm
        `the spouse is a woman`                                                          IS fem
        `the spouse's taxable income in the tax year`                                    IS 0
        `the spouse is insured under Chapter 11 of the National Insurance Law`           IS NOT fem
        `the spouse is a housewife as defined in section 238 of the National Insurance Law` IS fem
        `the spouse is resident in Israel, under the National Insurance Law`             IS TRUE

GIVEN s IS AN `IL-07 spouse`
      reg IS A BOOLEAN
      sep IS A BOOLEAN
      s37 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `IL-07 couple`
`i2: couple` s `, registered:` reg `, separate:` sep `, s37:` s37 MEANS
    `IL-07 couple` WITH
        `the earner's spouse`                                                            IS s
        `the earner is the registered spouse`                                            IS reg
        `the earner claims a separate calculation of the tax on the earner's income from personal exertion` IS sep
        `the earner would be entitled to a credit point under section 37 of the Income Tax Ordinance` IS s37

GIVEN nm IS A STRING
      dob IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `IL-07 child`
`i2: child` nm `, born:` dob MEANS
    `IL-07 child` WITH
        `the child's name`                                                               IS nm
        `the child's date of birth`                                                      IS dob
        `the child's mother elects to count one birth-year credit point in the following tax year` IS FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      m IS A NUMBER
      e IS AN `IL-07 earner`
      c IS A MAYBE `IL-07 couple`
      ks IS A LIST OF `IL-07 child`
      hl IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `IL-07 household in a month`
`i2: in` y `, month:` m `, earner:` e `, couple:` c `, children:` ks `, health:` hl MEANS
    `IL-07 household in a month` WITH
        `the year of the month`                                                          IS y
        `the month of the year`                                                          IS m
        `the earner`                                                                     IS e
        `the couple, if the earner has a spouse`                                         IS c
        `the children of the household`                                                  IS ks
        `the health insurance contribution the caller says is deducted for the month`    IS hl

GIVEN own IS A NUMBER
      emp IS A NUMBER
      ins IS A NUMBER
      life IS A NUMBER
      im IS A MAYBE `IL-07 the earner's immigration`
      s37 IS A MAYBE `IL-07 the statuses section 37 reads`
      s335 IS A MAYBE `IL-07 the earner's insurance statuses, for section 335`
      sp IS A MAYBE `IL-07 the single-parent family, for section 40(b)`
GIVETH AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
`i2: facts, own pension` own `, employer:` emp `, insured:` ins `, life:` life `, immigration:` im `, s37 statuses:` s37 `, s335 statuses:` s335 `, single parent:` sp MEANS
    `IL-07 further facts of the household` WITH
        `the earner's pension contributions and insurance`       IS `IL-07 the earner's pension contributions and insurance` WITH
            `the earner's own contribution to a pension provident fund, each month`          IS own
            `the employer's deposits to a pension provident fund for the earner, each month` IS emp
            `the part of the monthly salary that is insured income`                          IS ins
            `paid in the tax year for survivors' pension insurance`                          IS 0
            `paid in the tax year for insurance of the earner's or the spouse's life`        IS life
        `the earner's immigration, if the earner is an immigrant` IS im
        `the statuses section 37 reads, if given`                 IS s37
        `the earner's insurance statuses for section 335, if given` IS s335
        `the single-parent family, if given`                      IS sp

`i2: plain facts` MEANS `i2: facts, own pension` 0 `, employer:` 0 `, insured:` 0 `, life:` 0 `, immigration:` NOTHING `, s37 statuses:` NOTHING `, s335 statuses:` NOTHING `, single parent:` NOTHING

GIVEN er IS A BOOLEAN
      sr IS A BOOLEAN
      sb IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `IL-07 the statuses section 37 reads`
`i2: s37 statuses, earner retired` er `spouse retired` sr `spouse blind` sb MEANS
    `IL-07 the statuses section 37 reads` WITH
        `the earner has reached retirement age`                                          IS er
        `the earner's spouse has reached retirement age`                                 IS sr
        `the earner is blind or disabled within section 9(5)(a) or (a1)`                 IS FALSE
        `the earner's spouse is blind or disabled within section 9(5)(a) or (a1)`        IS sb
        `the earner proved to the assessing officer that the spouse's maintenance was on the earner in the tax year` IS TRUE

GIVEN acc IS A BOOLEAN
      unemp IS A BOOLEAN
      ctrl IS A BOOLEAN
      dis IS A BOOLEAN
      ltc IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `IL-07 the earner's insurance statuses, for section 335`
`i2: s335, accident` acc `unemployment` unemp `controlling` ctrl `disability` dis `long-term care` ltc MEANS
    `IL-07 the earner's insurance statuses, for section 335` WITH
        `the earner is insured under Chapter 5, work injury`                             IS TRUE
        `the earner is insured under Chapter 6, accident injury`                         IS acc
        `the earner is insured for unemployment, under paragraph (1) of insured in section 158` IS unemp
        `the earner is a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company`              IS ctrl
        `the earner is an employee insured under Chapter 8, insolvency`                  IS TRUE
        `the earner is insured under Chapter 9, disability`                              IS dis
        `the earner is insured for long-term care`                                       IS ltc
        `the earner is a widow pensioner as defined in section 238`                      IS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `IL-07 the earner's immigration`
`i2: immigrant under the Law of Return from` d MEANS
    `IL-07 the earner's immigration` WITH
        `the ground of immigration`                                                      IS `IL-07: an immigrant's visa or certificate under the Law of Return`
        `the earner's Israeli citizenship was cancelled under section 10(d) of the Citizenship Law` IS FALSE
        `the day the earner became an immigrant`                                         IS d
        `it was the first time the earner became an immigrant`                           IS TRUE
        `the Minister's rules under section 35(e) reach the earner`                      IS FALSE

GIVEN nm IS A STRING
      dead IS A BOOLEAN
      ores IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `IL-07 a child's other parent, for section 40(b)`
`i2: other parent of` nm `, dead:` dead `, resident:` ores MEANS
    `IL-07 a child's other parent, for section 40(b)` WITH
        `the name of the child`                                                          IS nm
        `the child's other parent died in or before the tax year`                        IS dead
        `the child is registered in the population register without the details of one parent` IS FALSE
        `the child's other parent is an Israeli resident in the tax year`                IS ores
        `the child's other parent has credit points for the child under section 40(b)(1)` IS FALSE

GIVEN spf IS A BOOLEAN
      apart IS A BOOLEAN
      share IS A NUMBER
      others IS A LIST OF `IL-07 a child's other parent, for section 40(b)`
GIVETH AN `IL-07 the single-parent family, for section 40(b)`
`i2: single-parent family:` spf `, living apart:` apart `, maintenance share:` share `, other parents:` others MEANS
    `IL-07 the single-parent family, for section 40(b)` WITH
        `the earner and the children are a single-parent family`                         IS spf
        `the earner maintained the children in the tax year`                             IS TRUE
        `the earner lives apart from the children's other parent`                        IS apart
        `the earner's share of the children's maintenance expenses`                     IS share
        `each child's other parent`                                                      IS others

-- The five figures for a household and its facts.
GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
      f IS AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`i2 tax` h f MEANS `IL-07: one twelfth of the income tax for the tax year, in` h `, with further facts` f
GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
      f IS AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`i2 ni` h f MEANS `IL-07: the national insurance contributions deducted from the salary for the month, in` h `, with further facts` f
GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
      f IS AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`i2 ni at the items` h f MEANS `IL-07: the national insurance contributions deducted from the salary for the month, in` h `, with further facts` f `, reading Schedule J column D as` `the sum of the items of the six deduction branches`
GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
      f IS AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`i2 health` h f MEANS (`IL-07: the household's month, in` h `, with further facts` f)'s `the health insurance contribution deducted for the month`
GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
      f IS AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`i2 allowance` h f MEANS `IL-07: the child allowance for the month, in` h `, with further facts` f
GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
      f IS AN `IL-07 further facts of the household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`i2 net` h f MEANS `IL-07: the net income of the household for the month, in` h `, with further facts` f

